OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain in the east, perhaps
OL,6,Fturning heavy at times before
OL,7,Fgradually easing through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Occasionally breezy around
OL,9,Fthe coasts. Generally dry in the west
OL,10,Fand somewhat cloudy to start, but some
OL,11,Fbright spells developing through the
OL,12,Fday.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy over the Caithness,
OL,15,FSutherland and the east with some
OL,16,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain,
OL,17,Fbecoming mostly dry overnight. Dry
OL,18,Fwith some clear spells in the west,
OL,19,Fturning cloudier overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
