OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly dry but somewhat
OL,6,Fcloudy to start but bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells developing through the day, as
OL,8,Fwell as a few sharp showers.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FThen
OL,11,Frain or showers at times, occasionally
OL,12,Fheavy, along with some drier and
OL,13,Fbrighter spells. Winds will be mostly
OL,14,Flight on Sunday, freshening on Monday
OL,15,Fand Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
